# Ladders: a grip with the hand on a ladder takes the astronaut onto it, pulling the hand down climbs, and letting go of
# the grip lets go of the ladder.
# Needs: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity). The test builds a ladder three shafts tall 1.6 m ahead (2.5 m cubes, the
# near face 35 cm ahead of the astronaut) with creative tools. The hand is put 55 cm ahead of the head, inside the shaft's cell.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet
admin creativeTools
# open ground: room to walk, nothing in the way
goto open
# three shafts, one on another: the game climbs only where there is ladder above the head
build LadderShaft 3 5
build LadderShaft 3 2.5
build LadderShaft 3 as Test ladder
# its near face 35 cm ahead (the cell is 2.5 m: its centre 1.6 m away)
goto Test ladder 1.6
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
wait 2

# before: standing on the ground, nothing gripped
read character
expect state == standing
expect no log Hull grab: Right hand takes

# the right hand into the ladder, grip: the astronaut is on the ladder
hand right 0.2 1.2 -0.55
wait 0.7
press right grip
wait 1
expect log Hull grab: Right hand takes within 5
read character
expect state == ladder

# hand over hand, as a player climbs: the hand that holds pulls down 80 cm, the other takes the ladder higher up and the
# first lets go. A step of the game's ladder (0.83 m here) starts at half a step's pull, then one for each step's pull,
# so four pulls of 80 cm climb four steps
mark
hand right 0.2 1.3 -0.55
wait 0.3
hand right 0.2 1.2 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 1.1 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 1.0 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.9 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.8 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.7 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.6 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.5 -0.55
wait 0.2
wait 1.2
hand left -0.2 1.3 -0.55
wait 0.4
press left grip
wait 0.4
release right grip
wait 0.2
expect log Hull grab: Left hand takes within 5
hand left -0.2 1.2 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 1.1 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 1.0 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.9 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.8 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.7 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.6 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.5 -0.55
wait 0.2
wait 1.2
hand right 0.2 1.3 -0.55
wait 0.4
press right grip
wait 0.4
release left grip
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 1.2 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 1.1 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 1.0 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.9 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.8 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.7 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.6 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand right 0.2 0.5 -0.55
wait 0.2
wait 1.2
hand left -0.2 1.3 -0.55
wait 0.4
press left grip
wait 0.4
release right grip
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 1.2 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 1.1 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 1.0 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.9 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.8 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.7 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.6 -0.55
wait 0.2
hand left -0.2 0.5 -0.55
wait 0.2
wait 1.2
read character
expect state == ladder
expect position moved > 2.0
expect log Hull grab: ladder step up within 5

# the grip let go: the plugin lets go of the ladder
release left grip
wait 1
expect log lets go of the ladder within 5
